### Create agent session (default system includes tool_call + question protocol)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agent": true,
  "messages": []
}

###
### Get session (history + state + pending tool_calls/question)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1

###
### Post a user turn → {session_id,key}
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Lista filer i projektet och föreslå nästa steg"
}

###
### Stream tokens
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1/tokens

###
### Job status (includes tool_calls / question when done)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/messages/1

###
### Client ran tools — send results, continues generation
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1/tools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tool_results": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "name": "execute_command",
      "content": "exit 0\nCMakeLists.txt\nsrc3\nREADME.md"
    }
  ]
}

###
### Client answered a multiple-choice question
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer_index": 0
}

###
### Or free-form answer
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "Gör option B"
}

###
### Delete session
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/sessions/1
